(:id "port/python/vt/wide-scalars" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/vtwide_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtWideRows (every manifest instance whose unit's table closure carries fixed(I, F), ufixed(I, F), int128 or uint128: scalars_full, scalars_default, scalars_edges as form 3, widelist_wide as form 1; the selection comes from ir.TableWideFields and must cover both declared forms)" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtwide_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtWideRowsNegativeControl/uint128-width, /fixed-signedness (each fault planted in a COPY of the emitted runtime: kind_int.py's uint128 width and fixedform.py's signed read)" "make python-vt-wide-rows python-vt-wide-rows-negative-control (make/python-vt-wide-rows.mk); make/negative-controls.d/python-vt-wide-rows-negative-control.json: python-vt-wide-rows-negative-control") :tested-revision "bbccd2f239a0f98d43484bd4d26b08658099a5cd" :note "2026-11-17: the wide-scalars row on the Python table leg. Every manifest instance whose unit carries a wide scalar is read once and written back byte-identical to the canonical wire, with measure equal to the saved length and the loaded value unchanged by the save, under both pinned interpreters (CPython 3.11.18 and 3.15.2 from make dist-python / the fleet SDK); scalars_full, scalars_default and scalars_edges are a fixed-declared root read as form 3 through the generated fixed form, and widelist_wide is a variable root read as form 1. A wire-refused instance, had the corpus named one, is held to its refusal with the caller's bytearray untouched. The report rows in the same units (scalars_full_as_2, scalars_edges_as_2, field_scalar_widen and the previous-form rows) are the widening cell's and stay green there. The negative control turns the uint128 width off in a copy of kind_int.py (widelist_wide red) and the fixed form's signed read off in a copy of fixedform.py (the form-3 instances red). Run on Linux x86-64 with SCHEMA_SLOW=1 and -tags schema_leg_python; the same head passed make generated-current. No hot path changed, so no bench row moved; the wide kinds ride the integer codec the table core bench already measures.")
